  "ingredients": [
    "2 tablespoons olive oil",
    "1.25 pounds 93%-lean ground turkey",
    "0.33333334326744 cup Italian seasoned bread crumbs",
    "1 large egg, beaten"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/qLzyFeJ4lsUCL6vEFb_mEH3Kxy0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-step-01-5eded48be40b45ad9debe7079f273b77.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85148/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Grease a 9x13-inch baking dish with oil, and place it into the oven while preheating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/R3vzZfqgN75h55oeh8ADoysA45M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-step-02-34cc3c8994564d339f7fe2c1cb84b1d9.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85148/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix turkey, bread crumbs, and egg together in a bowl with your hands.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vjs4KK5RGrWgJqUl7nrle5qUuyQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-step-03-6e369d56153b4db6ba5cfccf58ca8411.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85148/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Using an ice cream scoop if possible, form mixture into golf ball-sized meatballs. Place meatballs into the hot dish, about 1 inch apart. Press gently on each meatball to flatten the bottom just slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i1Vl8udGcrx_0Ut6bMwteSHSyWs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-step-04-e664981d4eea433284623bca3fa47148.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85148/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven for 15 minutes. Flip meatballs over and continue baking until somewhat crispy on the outside, about 5 more minutes. An instant-read thermometer inserted into the center should read at least 165 degrees F (74 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/JTNsbe62BJdXk2C_dNEnpp4xVNs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-step-05-b38a8dcb4bc24f57b22d490982f98cdd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85148/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve with pasta or sauce, or however you'd like.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zR4L8c7tdf_GMt_5dBjaz3JDnkk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-85148-Fast-and-Friendly-Meatballs-ddmfs-gw-4x3-hero-2fe7a4c257854573b7b32b014d0c716a.jpg"
